{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4256\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>游嘉欣日前分享了一段到日本靜岡縣伊豆體驗溪降（Canyoning）的短片。影片中她身穿裝備勇闖瀑布溪谷，期間更因過度驚恐而死攬教練手臂狂嗌，互動場面既刺激又爆笑！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4257\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>片中可見，游嘉欣跟隨教練一行人攀山涉水，展開人生第一次的「跳潭練習」。起初游嘉欣站在岩石邊緣猶豫不決，最後還是大膽跳入深潭，事後她直言：「哩一步好大勇氣，鼻入水最辛苦！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4257\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8985375f-c9d7-48df-88ec-7ff70cf42a90.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Mb88rVJa8u1790588447.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8985375f-c9d7-48df-88ec-7ff70cf42a90.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4258\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>隨後游嘉欣挑戰多個天然滑水梯，漸入佳境。然而當來到最高、水流最急的瀑布頂端時，恐懼感再度爆發！只見游嘉欣死死拉住教練的手臂不肯放，教練不斷勸說：「放手！去啦」，游嘉欣即時撒嬌慘叫：「唔制！」 豈料教練拋出一句「一生人一次」，便狠心拉開游嘉欣的手，直接將她推下瀑布滑入潭中！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4258\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3cf2b77a-808a-498a-b156-9d4bc2bcb86b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tDYzgcuD1s1790588447.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3cf2b77a-808a-498a-b156-9d4bc2bcb86b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa0b8bac-3f45-4f22-abb2-d4db6e38d49d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20261h7fu2Oh3Q1790588447.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa0b8bac-3f45-4f22-abb2-d4db6e38d49d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_5bb0d582a5a2b7b4-4259\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>游嘉欣浮出水面後見到周圍不少人圍觀，即時自嘲：「望到下面嘅人，瞬間覺得好丟架😂！」 不過順利完成挑戰後，她亦滿足表示這是「人生最勇敢嘅一日」。影片曝光後，圈中好友及網民紛紛留言狂讚：「游游好有膽量」、「解鎖新技能！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T10:19:13.448647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}